{"id":"39ceaa238375b998","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Adjoint Equivalence","display":"df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence — ZFC Cat2 Adjoint Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence — ZFC Cat2 Adjoint Equivalence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-category]]","[[58-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[58-df-functor]]","[[58-df-natural-transformation]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence — ZFC Cat2 Adjoint Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dfa5042443233c40\" href=\"?note=dfa5042443233c40\" title=\"58-df-adjoint-functors\">58-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"58-df-natural-transformation\">58-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d71c15e0342b2318\" href=\"?note=d71c15e0342b2318\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism\">58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\)</span> are the exact category, functor, and natural-transformation predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\)</span> records a specified unit, counit, and both triangle identities (defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d71c15e0342b2318\" href=\"?note=d71c15e0342b2318\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism\">58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2AdjointEquivalence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2AdjointEquivalence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}adjunction\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\epsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\epsilon_{F(X)}\\circ F(\\eta_X)=\\operatorname{id}_{F(X)}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal D)\\;\nG(\\epsilon_Y)\\circ\\eta_{G(Y)}=\\operatorname{id}_{G(Y)}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}adjunction\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\epsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\epsilon_{F(X)}\\circ F(\\eta_X)=\\operatorname{id}_{F(X)}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal D)\\;\nG(\\epsilon_Y)\\circ\\eta_{G(Y)}=\\operatorname{id}_{G(Y)}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2AdjointEquivalence}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\epsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2AdjointEquivalence}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\epsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An adjunction is an adjoint equivalence exactly when its specified unit and counit are natural isomorphisms.  The former call to the four-place adjunction predicate could hide a different unit/counit pair from the displayed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,\\epsilon\">\\(\\eta,\\epsilon\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dfa5042443233c40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d71c15e0342b2318","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d71c15e0342b2318","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2AdjointEquivalence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}adjunction\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\epsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\epsilon_{F(X)}\\circ F(\\eta_X)=\\operatorname{id}_{F(X)}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal D)\\;\nG(\\epsilon_Y)\\circ\\eta_{G(Y)}=\\operatorname{id}_{G(Y)}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2AdjointEquivalence}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AdjunctionData}_S(F,G,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\eta,1_{\\mathcal C},G\\circ F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\epsilon,F\\circ G,1_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D,\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta,\\epsilon","display":false}],"bytes":2606,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1571","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-adjoint-equivalence]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c","dfa5042443233c40","877f1061e295cf5f","970e2b8779070da0","d71c15e0342b2318","e637becf421e4e61"]}